The [[repository licence map>>https://github.com/robertschaub/FactHarbor/blob/main/LICENSE.md]] defines scope and exceptions. Third-party terms and required notices remain applicable. Commercial use is permitted under the applicable public licence. Alternative permissions may be agreed in writing with Robert Schaub for rights he owns or is authorised to license.

AGPL source obligations apply in the circumstances specified by that licence. CC BY-SA covers protected expression and shared adaptations; it does not require every implementation of a specification to be open source. Names, logos and trust marks are reserved as branding, subject to uses independently permitted by law.

